WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.793
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with

00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:06.045
communities across Africa.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.259
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:13.314
Rehearse a concrete change as a group.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:20.412
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions. Explain one

00:00:20.412 --> 00:00:23.671
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
